[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8105.189, "timestamp": "02:15:05", "text": "ブロンドで銅色のような色は似合わない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8107.83, "timestamp": "02:15:07", "text": "褐色の肌。いいえ、わかりません。私はしません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8112.31, "timestamp": "02:15:12", "text": "知る。色については特に考えがない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8115.669, "timestamp": "02:15:15", "text": "分析とか、それに関する何か。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8118.31, "timestamp": "02:15:18", "text": "色に関するものはたくさんあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8120.709, "timestamp": "02:15:20", "text": "韓国のサロンに行くと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8122.149, "timestamp": "02:15:22", "text": "そして、そこにはいろいろなものがあった。うん。うん。うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8123.669, "timestamp": "02:15:23", "text": "みんなその色を使ってる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8126.39, "timestamp": "02:15:26", "text": "分析とか、どんな色が見えるかとか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8129.35, "timestamp": "02:15:29", "text": "あなたは秋ですか？いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8131.43, "timestamp": "02:15:31", "text": "私に似合っているから、着てみようと思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8135.83, "timestamp": "02:15:35", "text": "それ。それが私の色彩分析のやり方です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8149.75, "timestamp": "02:15:49", "text": "あなたはいつになったら眠れるようになるの？もし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8152.629, "timestamp": "02:15:52", "text": "君を長く引き留めすぎている。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8156.55, "timestamp": "02:15:56", "text": "いいえ、それで構いません。えっと、私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 8156.997, "timestamp": "02:15:56", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "there is like silver metallic highlight it's newly got famous in boys it works great"}]